                <tr id="issuerow12478000" rel="12478000" data-issuekey="CXF-3078" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3078" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3078">CXF-3078</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Encoding warning with Maven 2.2.1 while building CXF sample projects.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Robert Liguori
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Robert Liguori
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Oct/10 15:55 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/Aug/11 14:43 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/May/11 21:27 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Build system            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I see an encoding warning when building CXF samples with Maven 2.2.1.<br/>
<br/>
[INFO] ------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>
[INFO] Building Apache CXF Code Generation Maven2 Plugins<br/>
[INFO]    task-segment: [clean, install]<br/>
[INFO] ------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>
...<br/>
[WARNING] Using platform encoding (Cp1252 actually) to read mojo metadata, i.e. build is platform dependent!<br/>
...<br/>
<br/>
This blog entry is close to what I am seeing:<br/>
([WARNING] Using platform encoding (Cp1252 actually) to copy filtered resources, i.e. build is platform dependent!)<br/>
<br/>
http://blog.vinodsingh.com/2009/04/encoding-warning-with-maven-210.html<br/>
<br/>
I think it&#39;s best to remove warnings where possible... as such, should the CXF POM files be updated with something similar to this:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;properties&gt;<br/>
    &lt;project.build.sourceEncoding&gt;UTF-8&lt;/project.build.sourceEncoding&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/properties&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Or would this affect backwards compatibility?<br/>
<br/>
Thanks!<br/>

  </td>
