                <tr id="issuerow12478200" rel="12478200" data-issuekey="CXF-3090" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3090" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3090">CXF-3090</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JAX-RS Trailing slashes required for first access
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Patrick Leamon
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Patrick Leamon
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/Oct/10 01:01 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 06/Dec/10 22:49 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 02/Nov/10 19:50 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.10            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.12,                     2.3.1,                     2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Running in tomcat via cargo
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have a CXFServlet configured with a url pattern of /service/*<br/>
In my beans definition I have a  &lt;jaxrs:server address=&quot;/description&quot;&gt;...<br/>
The service bean mapped to this has no @Path annotation, just a method with an @GET.<br/>
<br/>
This leads to some odd behaviour.  If the first attempt to access the servlet goes to the url &quot;/service/description&quot;, a 404 is returned.  If a trailing slash is added so the url becomes &quot;/service/description/&quot;, the service works fine.  Once any access to the servlet has matched a url correctly, then &quot;/service/description&quot; (no trailing slash) works fine.<br/>
<br/>
It would be great if this could be accessed consistently.  Either require a traliing slash or allow the request without it.  Preferably the latter.
  </td>
