                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-3963                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I dont know if it was already discussed in the past... from a Maven user point of view, I think it will be a good addon to have the &quot;standardized&quot; Maven website for Cxf plugins (I mean using the mvn site and the maven-plugin-plugin)<br/>
The doc http://cxf.apache.org/docs/maven-java2ws-plugin.html is IMHO not enough. Also, a lot of javadoc is missing in Mojo source code.<br/>
I guess Dan could do it but I am happy to help, if needed, just ping me.<br/>

