                                            <td class="description">      We would like to use the jaxws:endpoint  namespace support but we just can&#39;t since we have to copy/paste the base configuration every time we want to deploy a new endpoint. Having the ability to define an abstract endpoint by name and use that name in a concrete endpoint with the parent attribute.<br/>
