                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The following utitlies have the &quot;-validate&quot; option which instructs the tool to validate the WSDL document before attempting to generate any code:<br/>
<br/>
  -- wsdl2js <br/>
  -- wsdl2java<br/>
<br/>
This -validate option would be useful with other WSDL transformation utilities, such as the following:<br/>
<br/>
  -- wsdl2xml<br/>
  -- wsdl2service<br/>
  -- wsdl2soap<br/>
  -- wsdl2corba<br/>

  </td>
