    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3130" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3130">CXF-3130</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Aegis throws (and throws up) when an ExceptionInInitializerError happens while introspecting
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
