                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      org.apache.cxf.aegis.type.java5.AnnotationReader, the function &#39;load&#39; carefully traps ClassNotFoundException to allow it to just float along past problems with classes that are referenced in services. However, there might also be an ExceptionInInitializerError, and those pass through.<br/>
<br/>
In both cases, logging+returning null seems appropriate.<br/>

