                <tr id="issuerow12480314" rel="12480314" data-issuekey="CXF-3132" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3132" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3132">CXF-3132</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                asynchronous client can&#39;t get correct error if non-runtimeexcpetion happen
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 18/Nov/10 09:17 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 06/Dec/10 22:49 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 19/Nov/10 09:40 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3,                     2.2.11            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.12,                     2.3.1,                     2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      when use asynchronous cxf client handler, if there&#39;s a non-runtimeexception thrown, the asynchronous client handler can&#39;t get correct reason but get TimeoutException.<br/>
<br/>
For example if client receive a very complex soap message response with a greate amount of element level like<br/>
&lt;soap:envelope&gt;&lt;soap:body&gt;&lt;a1&gt;&lt;a2&gt;...&lt;an&gt;&lt;/an&gt;...&lt;/a2&lt;/a2&gt;&lt;/soap:body&gt;&lt;/soap:envelope&gt;<br/>
here n could be very big which can cause StackOverflowError in StatxUtils as StatxUtils use recursive way to parse soap message.<br/>
<br/>
In this case if we use asynchronous cxf client, the client has no way to know there&#39;s a StackOverflowError but just get TimeoutException.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
