</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I did some clean up work[1] on the CxfRsInvoker in Camel to let it work better with CXF 2.3.0 continuation API.<br/>
<br/>
Current JAXRSInvoker is not friendly to CXF continuation API, and the method<br/>
{code}<br/>
public Object invoke(Exchange exchange, Object request)<br/>
{code}<br/>
is stateful and can&#39;t be called by the continuation resume process.<br/>
<br/>
[1]http://svn.apache.org/viewvc?rev=1036343&amp;view=rev<br/>

  </td>
