                <tr id="issuerow12480437" rel="12480437" data-issuekey="CXF-3137" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3137" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3137">CXF-3137</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Simplify http connection factory in http transport  (please review)
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Nov/10 18:22 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Dec/10 21:55 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 01/Dec/10 21:51 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently the http transport uses a quite complicated way to create http url connections. There are two factories (for http and https). One is selected and cached. Then when you change the config of the transport it is eventually replaced. <br/>
<br/>
I propose to make this much simpler by having only a https url connection factory that also handles the http case. The new code has one little drawback it also eliminates the ConnectionInfo classes partly. I think that is not a big issue as I think this classes are only used for https trust decisions. It would be great though if someone could review the patch.<br/>

  </td>
