                                            <td class="description">      BusFactory.defaultBus is a static strong reference. I think I&#39;ve proved that this is why CXF builds like to run out of memory.<br/>
<br/>
I have a fix, I think, but I thought that this was a change that deserved tracking in JIRA.<br/>

