                <tr id="issuerow12480534" rel="12480534" data-issuekey="CXF-3143" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3143" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3143">CXF-3143</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                SOAPBindingUtil &#39;leaks&#39; proxy classes
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Nov/10 15:46 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/Aug/11 14:43 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/May/11 01:47 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3,                     2.2.11            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.12,                     2.3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Soap Binding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      org.apache.cxf.tools.util.SOAPBindingUtil.getProxy(Class&lt;T&gt;, Object) creates proxies in the same class loader as the class it is proxying.<br/>
<br/>
This essentially leaks them,  since the classes being proxied are prone to be in the system class loader, but the proxies are being created on behalf of the current thread.<br/>
<br/>
The simplest improvement is to create them in the context class loader, so that (for example) the wsdl2java mojo can arrange for them to be GC-ed.<br/>
<br/>
Another interesting question is whether there should be some sort of cache: it seems to me that we&#39;re creating proxies for the same IBM WSDL soap binding impl class over and over.<br/>

  </td>
