                <tr id="issuerow12480547" rel="12480547" data-issuekey="CXF-3145" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3145" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3145">CXF-3145</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Refactor toSQL method as visitor pattern
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Brian Topping
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Brian Topping
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Nov/10 23:59 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Apr/11 12:44 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Jan/11 13:45 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In doing some work with the FIQL parser, I needed to generate a different output than SQL.  By using a visitor pattern for rendering the SQL, any visitor can be applied to the SearchCondition object graph.<br/>
<br/>
The attached patch provides that refactoring. <br/>
<br/>
As a part of that, SearchCondition.toSql() is deprecated, but I maintained the interface for maximum compatibility.  <br/>
<br/>
There was also a change to SearchCondition.getSearchConditions().  There were no callers to that code except test code, and it was set up to return null if there was only one condition.  That wasn&#39;t clear to me, hopefully that change is not unreasonable.<br/>
<br/>
This may not be formatted properly, please adjust to suit.
  </td>
