                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If the MTOM is not enabled in the wsdl , the mtom can not be activated through spring configuration xml :<br/>
<br/>
&lt;jaxws:endpoint id=&quot;mtomTest&quot; implementor=&quot;org.apache.cxf.MTOMImpl&quot; address=&quot;http://localhost:9090/mtomTest&quot;&gt;<br/>
   &lt;soap:soapBinding mtomEnabled=&#39; true&#39;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/jaxws:endpoint&gt;<br/>
<br/>
We probably can provide another mtom element parser like wsa parser to add it to the feature list and activate the Mtom.  <br/>
<br/>
<br/>

