<br/>
Part of the problem MAY be that Metro prefixes the Assertion key with a &quot;#&quot; indicating the token is within the message body.  A bug report has been sent to them on this issue[2], however I believe CXF would presently fail even if the &quot;#&quot; was not there, as the client-side storage/retrieval of SAML tokens is not yet in place.<br/>
<br/>
[1] https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12460040/WSS238Results.txt<br/>
[2] http://java.net/jira/browse/WSIT-1490
