                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We still have to much duplicated or very similar code in the http transports. <br/>
<br/>
Moving header code from AbstractHttpDestination to Headers<br/>
Moving invokeDestination from ServletController to AbstractServletController to share this code with http-osgi<br/>
Moving invoke from ServletDestination to AbstractHttpDestination  to share this code with http-osgi<br/>
Removing doMessage from OsgiDestination<br/>
Removing invokeDestination from OsgiServletcontroller<br/>
Ignoring some mock based tests that do not work anymore. Will have to do some work on them<br/>
<br/>
There are some small changes in the behaviour for http-osgi as we are now using the servlet code here. It would be great if Sergey or Dan could review this. Idon´t think the differences are important but I am not sure.<br/>

