                <tr id="issuerow12492081" rel="12492081" data-issuekey="CXF-3165" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3165" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3165">CXF-3165</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                SUN_TOOL_PATH references legacy vendor
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Robert Liguori
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Robert Liguori
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Dec/10 23:07 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Jan/11 18:14 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 08/Jan/11 04:18 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Consider the Identifier  SUN_TOOL_PATH in the tool scripts.<br/>
<br/>
Sun (as in SUN_TOOL_PATH) is now Oracle... this wasn&#39;t a good idea of putting the vendor&#39;s name in the the identifier name.<br/>
<br/>
Consider renaming SUN_TOOL_PATH to JAVA_SE_TOOL_PATH or something similar.  Of course, Java SE is for JDK 1.6 and J2SE is for JDK 1.5. <br/>
<br/>
TOOL_PATH by itself, leaves confusion as the assumption may be for the CXF tool path, thus why SUN was probably added in the first place.<br/>
<br/>
The recommendation is to make the update in all of the tool scripts (e.g. wsdl2java).<br/>
<br/>
Thanks!
  </td>
