                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Expressions like<br/>
<br/>
&quot;/foo/{bar}{resource:(/format/[^/]+?)?}&quot;<br/>
<br/>
are not working in CXF 2.3.1 due to the change required to make expressions like<br/>
<br/>
&quot;/{resource:.+\\.(js|css|gif|png)}&quot;<br/>
<br/>
processed properly.<br/>
<br/>
&quot;/foo/{bar}{resource:(/format/[^/]+?)?}&quot; was actually not processed properly even before 2.3.0, the match was successful but<br/>
the actual value of the &quot;resource&quot; var was incorrect<br/>

  </td>
