  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Receiving the following error:<br/>
<br/>
[12/6/10 17:05:28:140 EST] 00000068 PhaseIntercep I   Interceptor has thrown exception, unwinding now Unmarshalling Error: Duplicate declaration for namespace prefix &#39;tns&#39;.<br/>
 at [row,col {unknown-source}]: [1,506] <br/>
[12/6/10 17:05:28:187 EST] 00000068 DispatcherPor E org.springframework.web.portlet.FrameworkPortlet processRequest Could not complete request<br/>
                                 javax.xml.ws.WebServiceException: org.apache.cxf.interceptor.Fault: Unmarshalling Error: Duplicate declaration for namespace prefix &#39;tns&#39;.<br/>
