                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 04/Jan/11 03:47 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3,                     2.3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The OSGi http transport is not propertly registered on the http://cxf.apache.org/transports/http transportId.  Thus, the SOAPTransportFactory cannot properly map it and OSGi services fail to start.<br/>
<br/>
Workaround is to add a transportId=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/wsdl/http/&quot; to the jaxws:endpoint definitions in the spring-dm beans.xml.<br/>

  </td>
