----------------------------------------<br/>
Encoding: UTF-8<br/>
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=UTF-8<br/>
Headers: {content-type=[text/xml; charset=UTF-8], connection=[keep-alive], Host=[localhost:9000], Content-Length=[256], SOAPAction=[&quot;&quot;], User-Agent=[Apache CXF 2.3.2-SNAPSHOT], Content-Type=[text/xml; charset=UTF-8], Accept=[*/*], Pragma=[no-cache], Cache-Control=[no-cache]}<br/>
Payload: &lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;&lt;soap:Header&gt;&lt;MU xmlns=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/mu&quot; soap:mustUnderstand=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;/soap:Header&gt;&lt;soap:Body&gt;&lt;pingOneWay xmlns=&quot;http://apache.org/handler_test/types&quot;/&gt;&lt;/soap:Body&gt;&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
