</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Link to Forum: http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/XmlBeans-with-contentType-text-xml-doesn-t-work-td3308350.html<br/>
<br/>
XmlBeansElementProvider supports only application/xml. Should support &quot;application/xml&quot;, &quot;application/*+xml&quot;, &quot;text/xml&quot;.<br/>
This means that when a REST Client uses text/xml, it gets a HTTP 415.
  </td>
