</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Have XJC-Util work with both JAXB 2.1 and JAXB 2.2
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
