                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When building the CXF-Trunk (mvn install -Pfastinstall) if I have JAXB 2.2 (jaxb-api.jar) in my JDK 6 endorsed directory the cxf-api build fails (possibly others would fail as well) due to the XJC tooling expecting JAXB 2.1:<br/>
