    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3212" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3212">CXF-3212</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                wsdl2java code generation problem
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            srikanth vattikonda
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            srikanth vattikonda
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Dec/10 07:55 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Apr/11 12:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 14/Mar/11 21:52 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi am trying to generate java code from wsdl file using cxf-codegen-plugin by using maven. But I am facing some problem because of one child element having the same name as of parent element.Please find my configurations below:<br/>
<br/>
1) POM file plugin configuration: <br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
				&lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.cxf&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
				&lt;artifactId&gt;cxf-codegen-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
				&lt;version&gt;2.2.2&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
				&lt;executions&gt;<br/>
					&lt;execution&gt;<br/>
						&lt;configuration&gt;<br/>
							&lt;wsdlOptions&gt;<br/>
						 	&lt;wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
									&lt;wsdl&gt;<br/>
										src/main/resources/AmadeusWebServices.wsdl<br/>
									&lt;/wsdl&gt;<br/>
									&lt;extraargs&gt;<br/>
										&lt;extraarg&gt;-b&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
                                  		&lt;extraarg&gt;src/main/resources/binding.xml&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
	                            		&lt;extraarg&gt;-exsh&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
                                  		&lt;extraarg&gt;true&lt;/extraarg&gt; <br/>
                                  		&lt;!-- &lt;extraarg&gt;-noAddressBinding&lt;/extraarg&gt; --&gt;<br/>
                                  		&lt;extraarg&gt;-autoNameResolution&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
                                  		&lt;extraarg&gt;-verbose&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
                               		 &lt;/extraargs&gt;<br/>
								&lt;/wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
							&lt;/wsdlOptions&gt;<br/>
						&lt;/configuration&gt;<br/>
						&lt;goals&gt;<br/>
							&lt;goal&gt;wsdl2java&lt;/goal&gt;<br/>
						&lt;/goals&gt;<br/>
					&lt;/execution&gt;<br/>
				&lt;/executions&gt;<br/>
			&lt;/plugin&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
2) binding.xml configuration:<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;jaxws:bindings<br/>
    xmlns:xsd=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema&quot;<br/>
    xmlns:wsdl=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/wsdl/&quot;<br/>
    xmlns=&quot;http://java.sun.com/xml/ns/jaxws&quot;<br/>
    xmlns:jaxws=&quot;http://java.sun.com/xml/ns/jaxws&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;enableWrapperStyle&gt;false&lt;/enableWrapperStyle&gt;<br/>
&lt;/jaxws:bindings&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
3) My xsd file imported in wsdl:<br/>
{code}<br/>
