                <tr id="issuerow12494421" rel="12494421" data-issuekey="CXF-3226" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3226" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3226">CXF-3226</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Going to a JAX-RS resource that contains a space in the path returns a 404 response code
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jason Downey
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jason Downey
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/Jan/11 23:22 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Feb/11 18:45 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 08/Jan/11 19:55 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.2,                     2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Java 1.6_22<br/>
Apache CXF 2.3.1
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      If you go to a JAX-RS resource that contains a space in the path, the Apache CXF JAX-RS runtime returns a 404 response code. In the STDERR log, you&#39;ll see the following message:<br/>
<br/>
Jan 1, 2011 3:05:01 PM org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.utils.JAXRSUtils findTargetMethod<br/>
WARNING: .No operation matching request path /has%20space is found, HTTP Method : GET, ContentType : */*, Accept : application/xml,application/xhtml+xml,image/png,text/html;q=0.9,text/plain;q=0.8,*/*;q=0.5,.<br/>
<br/>
The cause for this problem may be found in AbstractServerController.getBaseURL. It assumes pathInfo is always decoded but in the JAX-RS situation, it may actually still be encoded.<br/>
<br/>
Relevant sample code + patch attached.
  </td>
