                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If you set up a service with a bean with a DataHandler and the usual JAXB annotation for mime type, but you don&#39;t enable MTOM, the server side will leak bytes arrays like there is no tomorrow.<br/>
<br/>
I have a project underway I hope to produce a test case for this, but i&#39;m filing this for the record.<br/>

