                <tr id="issuerow12495824" rel="12495824" data-issuekey="CXF-3253" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3253" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3253">CXF-3253</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                LocalConduit with DirectDispatch does not work with interceptors that decorate the OutputStream
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sven Zethelius
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sven Zethelius
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Jan/11 21:27 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Mar/11 15:53 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Feb/11 22:19 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.10,                     2.3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Found in CXF 2.2.10, confirmed the code is the same in 2.3.1<br/>
Windows 2003 Server x64
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Create a Client that uses the local transport.<br/>
Set property org.apache.cxf.transport.local.LocalConduit.directDispatch<br/>
Add an Out interceptor to the Client that decorates the OutputStream.  For example GZIPOutInterceptor.<br/>
<br/>
Expected: <br/>
decorated OutputStream to work.<br/>
<br/>
Actual:<br/>
ClassCastException<br/>
<br/>
Cause:<br/>
{code:title=org.apache.cxf.transport.local.LocalConduit.dispatchDirect(Message)}<br/>
        CachedOutputStream stream = (CachedOutputStream)message.getContent(OutputStream.class);<br/>
{code}<br/>
This code is assuming the message OutputStream hasn&#39;t been wrapped.  My suggested fix would be to store the CachedContentStream you need to manipulate as a property of the Message, in addition to the setContent, so that even if the setContent is manipulated the other property would still be available.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
