                <tr id="issuerow12496039" rel="12496039" data-issuekey="CXF-3259" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3259" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3259">CXF-3259</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CXF hangs after many transactions on one client proxy using MTOM
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Ian Helmke
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Ian Helmke
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Jan/11 18:54 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Jan/11 18:18 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 20/Jan/11 15:51 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      All Linux/OSX
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF is hanging and timing out with a java.net.SocketTimeoutException after we attempt a number of transactions. The exact number of transactions that go through successfully before we get the exception varies widely; I have seen as few as 200 run successfully or as many as several thousand. It consistently does eventually fail and throw an exception, however. We are using MTOM.<br/>
<br/>
A git repository with sample code and a junit test case that fairly reliably reproduces this problem can be found at: https://github.com/basis-technology-corp/cxf-connection-timeout<br/>
<br/>
The stacktrace is as follows:<br/>
