                <tr id="issuerow12496217" rel="12496217" data-issuekey="CXF-3262" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3262" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3262">CXF-3262</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JAX-RS: Performance Improvement: Don&#39;t use IllegalArgumentException to determine if a URI chunk is a variable or literal
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Ka-Lok Fung
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Ka-Lok Fung
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Jan/11 02:47 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Mar/11 15:53 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Jan/11 10:21 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.3,                     2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">10800</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">10800</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      JDK 1.6
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Profiling the Apache CXF JAX-RS code shows that more time than necessary is being spent in UriChunk.createUriChunk because it uses an IllegalArgumentException to determine whether a URI chunk should be a literal or a variable. Creating exceptions is expensive :(<br/>
<br/>
Instead of using IllegalArgumentException, perhaps you can have a method that is like the following:<br/>
<br/>
public static Variable.create(String uriChunk)<br/>
<br/>
where null will be returned if uriChunk is not a variable. This way you can avoid the overhead of creating the unnecessary stack trace.
  </td>
