                <tr id="issuerow12496218" rel="12496218" data-issuekey="CXF-3263" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3263" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3263">CXF-3263</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                DoubleType incorrectly prints scientific notation
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jon Osborn
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jon Osborn
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Jan/11 02:56 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Apr/11 12:42 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/Mar/11 03:28 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Aegis Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-2847                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      all
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      This issue is directly related to BigDecimalType issue:<br/>
https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2847<br/>
<br/>
The DoubleType calls Double.toString() which uses scientific notation if the value is outside a particular range:<br/>
<br/>
http://download.oracle.com/javase/6/docs/api/java/lang/Double.html#toString(double)<br/>
<br/>
This is incorrect. The double type should only include negative sign, period, and numbers per the specification.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

