                                            <td class="description">      Hi Guys:<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m noticing a bug when trying to read the value of a @FormParam variable within a Resource Service. I&#39;ve reported what I&#39;m seeing on the mailing list:<br/>
<br/>
http://s.apache.org/jc<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve also confirmed that this isn&#39;t related to CXF-3147. <br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve filed OODT-118 to track this on the OODT end.<br/>
<br/>
Any help would be appreciated.<br/>
<br/>
Cheers,<br/>
Chris<br/>

