                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Generated &lt;p&gt; do not have end tags.<br/>
<br/>
Use case: <br/>
wsdl2java http://www.ignyte.com/webservices/ignyte.whatsshowing.webservice/moviefunctions.asmx?wsdl<br/>
<br/>
Example for ArrayOfMovies.java:<br/>
<br/>
/**<br/>
 * &lt;p&gt;Java class for ArrayOfMovie complex type.<br/>
 * <br/>
 * &lt;p&gt;The following schema fragment specifies the expected content contained within this class.<br/>
 * <br/>
 * &lt;pre&gt;<br/>
 * &amp;lt;complexType name=&quot;ArrayOfMovie&quot;&gt;<br/>
 *   &amp;lt;complexContent&gt;<br/>
 *     &amp;lt;restriction base=&quot;{http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema}anyType&quot;&gt;<br/>
 *       &amp;lt;sequence&gt;<br/>
 *         &amp;lt;element name=&quot;Movie&quot; type=&quot;{http://www.ignyte.com/whatsshowing}Movie&quot; maxOccurs=&quot;unbounded&quot; minOccurs=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;<br/>
 *       &amp;lt;/sequence&gt;<br/>
 *     &amp;lt;/restriction&gt;<br/>
 *   &amp;lt;/complexContent&gt;<br/>
 * &amp;lt;/complexType&gt;<br/>
 * &lt;/pre&gt;<br/>
 * <br/>
 * <br/>
 */<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Recommendation is to add &lt;/p&gt; end tags where appropriate.
  </td>
