                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      for example, if comment like this<br/>
/**<br/>
some comment<br/>
**/<br/>
then we get exception like<br/>
Error : line 73:3: unexpected char: &#39;/&#39;<br/>
<br/>
org.apache.cxf.tools.common.ToolException: line 73:3: unexpected char: &#39;/&#39;<br/>
