Caused by: line 73:3: unexpected char: &#39;/&#39;<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.tools.corba.processors.idl.IDLLexer.nextToken(IDLLexer.java:356)<br/>
	at antlr.TokenStreamHiddenTokenFilter.consume(TokenStreamHiddenTokenFilter.java:38)<br/>
