	at org.apache.cxf.tools.corba.processors.idl.IDLProcessor.process(IDLProcessor.java:71)<br/>
	... 26 more<br/>
<br/>
However, if we change the comment a little bit like<br/>
<br/>
/**<br/>
some comment<br/>
 **/    <br/>
only difference between the one doesn&#39;t work is this working one last line start with a whitespace<br/>
<br/>
or<br/>
/*<br/>
some comment<br/>
*/<br/>
then it works
