                <tr id="issuerow12497538" rel="12497538" data-issuekey="CXF-3304" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3304" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3304">CXF-3304</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                WebClient POST to a resource that returns 401 returns a blank InputStream when there&#39;s supposed to be text
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jason Downey
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jason Downey
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 03/Feb/11 05:25 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Mar/11 15:53 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Feb/11 13:01 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.3,                     2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      JDK 1.6<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have two methods that return the same error message upon POST. The only difference is that one returns a 404 response status, the other returns a 401 response status.<br/>
<br/>
POSTing to the resource that returns 404 returns an InputStream containing the error message when you call Response.getEntity(). However, POSTing to the resource that returns 401 returns a blank InputStream when you call Response.getEntity().<br/>
<br/>
This problem was not reproducible with GET.<br/>
<br/>
Test case code attached. Launch the server using JettyServer. Then run the WebClient test in WebClientTest.
  </td>
