                <tr id="issuerow12497559" rel="12497559" data-issuekey="CXF-3305" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3305" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3305">CXF-3305</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Request payload as StaxSource: first event is -1
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andrei Shakirin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andrei Shakirin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 03/Feb/11 13:24 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Mar/11 15:53 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Feb/11 17:35 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.1,                     2.3.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Use case: provider is implements Provider&lt;Source&gt; interface and uses PAYLOAD mode. By request, I get a StaxSource which wrappers the Stax reader.<br/>
<br/>
If I go through Stax reader the first event type is -1.<br/>
That disturbs, for example, to directly convert stream reader to event reader :<br/>
<br/>
XMLEventReader reader = inputFactory.createXMLEventReader()<br/>
Exception: <br/>
Caused by: java.lang.IllegalStateException: Unrecognized event type -1. at com.ctc.wstx.evt.DefaultEventAllocator.allocate(DefaultEventAllocator.java:259))<br/>
<br/>
As far as I skip first event, code above works.<br/>
<br/>
Are there any special reasons to put event (-1) on top of reader?<br/>

  </td>
