                                            <td class="description">      The current WS-RM code uses BigInteger for all sequence numbers, making the code to compare and work with sequence numbers very cumbersome. Changing to long values would still allow for over 291,271 years of continuous operation at 1 million operations per second, so is probably sufficient.
