                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      &quot;ws-security.ut.no-callbacks&quot; is not a very good property name and it&#39;s specific to UT only. Besides, with the new WSS4J coming in this name will not make sense. It needs to be renamed to <br/>
&quot;ws-security.validate.token&quot;
  </td>
