                <tr id="issuerow12498196" rel="12498196" data-issuekey="CXF-3324" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3324" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3324">CXF-3324</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JAXRSUtils: Avoid calling Message unless it&#39;ll be logged
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Ka-Lok Fung
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Ka-Lok Fung
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Feb/11 06:34 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Mar/11 15:53 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/Feb/11 18:01 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">3600</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">3600</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      JDK 1.6
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Our performance and reliability testing has shown that Message.toString() is called many times in JAXRSUtils.selectResourceClass and JAXRSUtils.findTargetMethod. It takes up 2.5% of our CPU when these messages aren&#39;t even being logged. An image from the profiler showing this hotspot is attached.<br/>
<br/>
According to our tests, if you pre-check if the message is loggable (e.g., if (LOG.isLoggable(Level.FINE))) and logging is set to the default level, the throughput is increased by 2% and the CPU time is reduced by an equal amount. The lines where this change would have the most impact are indicated in the image.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     0%
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     0%
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate">3600</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate">3600</td>
                                            <td class="labels">    JAXRSUtils, log, performance</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310060">    Novice
</td>
