                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The LoggingInInterceptor and LoggingOutInterceptor do not log the HTTP method being used.  I think it would be useful to log this, especially for REST services where its common to use alternative HTTP methods (PUT, POST, GET) compared to SOAP where it&#39;s pretty much always a POST.<br/>

