                                            <td class="environment">      Linux Ubuntu 10.04, JDK 1.6.0_20
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Using wsdl2java there is the irritating error message &#39;Content is not allowed in prolog&#39; depending on an empty schema include: &lt;include schemaLocation=&quot;&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
It might be better to throw a file/url not found exception.<br/>
<br/>
Hint:<br/>
There is no schema validation error in ecplise 3.6.<br/>
Also soapUi has no problem to load the wsdl.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
