                <tr id="issuerow12499068" rel="12499068" data-issuekey="CXF-3350" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3350" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3350">CXF-3350</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JAXRSClientFactoryBean selects a wrong user resource when the model includes multiple resource descriptions
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 18/Feb/11 17:07 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Apr/11 12:42 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/Feb/11 17:08 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Reusing the model in a common module between server and client code does not work well in cases where the model describes multiple root resources - currently JAXRSClientFactoryBean assumes only a single ClassResourceInfo can be created.<br/>
<br/>
With the model containing multiple resource descriptions it does not work reliably. The fix will insure the correct resource is selected
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310060"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310220"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312322"></td>
