                <tr id="issuerow12499288" rel="12499288" data-issuekey="CXF-3353" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3353" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3353">CXF-3353</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                can&#39;t refer to java.lang.Exception in gererated fault code
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Feb/11 01:40 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/May/11 06:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/Feb/11 14:17 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.3,                     2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-3491                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      if wsdl and wsdl types are using same name namespace, also in the types we define a fault with name<br/>
&lt;element name=&quot;exception&quot;&gt;<br/>
then generated code like<br/>
public class ServiceException extends Exception {<br/>
The exception here should be java.lang.Exception,<br/>
but the java compile consider it as inner faulttype org.apache.hello_world_soap_http_provider.Exception in the<br/>
same package, which cause compilation error.<br/>
<br/>
We should always use java.lang.Exception in the generated code to avoid such error
  </td>
