</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-1816                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When configuring Log4jLogger as in http://cxf.apache.org/docs/debugging-and-logging.html (using any of the options described), a SecurityPermission of {{setContextClassLoader}} is required in order to allow org.apache.cxf.common.logging.Log4jLogger to be loaded successfully. This is a consequence of using {{BugHacks.doHacks();}} in the Log4jLogger&#39;s static block. <br/>
<br/>
The required security permission {{setContextClassLoader}} to load a class seams inadequate.<br/>

  </td>
