                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      There is no wsdl element generated for Exception class: <br/>
<br/>
@WebService(name = &quot;CalculatorService&quot;, targetNamespace = &quot;http://cxf.apache.org/calculator&quot;)<br/>
public class Caculator {<br/>
    @WebMethod(operationName = &quot;addNumber&quot;)<br/>
    public Integer addNumber(@WebParam(name = &quot;itemA&quot;) Integer itemA, @WebParam(name = &quot;ItemB&quot;) Integer itemB)<br/>
        throws java.lang.Exception {<br/>
<br/>
        return itemA + itemB;<br/>
    }<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
The schema element, wsdl part , fault and soap fault elements are expected. 
