                <tr id="issuerow12500124" rel="12500124" data-issuekey="CXF-3373" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3373" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3373">CXF-3373</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Allow for providing classloader for bus extensions resolution
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/Mar/11 23:30 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Apr/11 12:42 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Mar/11 17:40 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4,                     2.3.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Bus            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently the ExtensionManagerBus uses the Thread.currentThread().getContextClassLoader() (TCCL) to look for the bus extension configuration files.<br/>
This improvement jira is about adding a new constructor flavour for passing in a classloader to use for that (btw the ExtensionManagerImpl already seems to have been thought to support this usecase); the idea behind this effort is in allowing to build a bus without requiring the Apache CXF libs to be visible in the user context classloader at runtime.
  </td>
