                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF Service Builder fails if the binding is imported from different file and has different target namespace than one imported into.<br/>
In a scenario where the binding is in different wsdl file from service and import namespace in service wsdl for binding is different from service namespace and binding&#39;s targetNamespace WSDL Service builder fails to generate namespace prefix on definition. <br/>
<br/>
I have a testcase and fix for this issue which I will merge shortly. <br/>
<br/>

