</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add a new option in WSD2Java to skip the generate the type classes from schema
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
