</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In some cases where the schemas are not inluded in all wsdl&#39;s directly or indirectly it&#39;s painful to have separate build sections in plugin or wsdl2java commandlines since xjc would make codegen fail if it doesn&#39;t find the schmea on which customization is to be applied is not part of any direct/indirect import in any wsdl when one specify wsdl&#39;s with wildcard or filter.<br/>
If the codegen plugin can give option to specify disabling code generation for schemas it will be helpful to have more control over code generation and jaxb customization on schema.<br/>

