                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Provide JAX-RS resource for users be able to download log files via browsers 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
