                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      LogBrowser will let people check log files. However in some case people may just want to get the actual file. Providing a JAX-RS resource which can serve the individual log files may be a good alternative to:<br/>
- reading the files on the local system which may not be easy to get to<br/>
- pushing log entries to consoles<br/>
<br/>
JAX-RS module might need to be enhanced for multipart/form-data writes be supported for browsers...
