                <tr id="issuerow12502730" rel="12502730" data-issuekey="CXF-3432" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3432" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3432">CXF-3432</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Support WS-SecurityPolicy SamlToken expressions
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Mar/11 15:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Apr/11 12:44 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Apr/11 12:17 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-3225                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
This task is to add support to CXF for WS-SecurityPolicy SamlToken assertions. CXF 2.4 will ship with WSS4J 1.6, which gives much better SAML support via an upgrade to OpenSaml2. Support for SAML tokens in WS-SecurityPolicy is currently limited to the IssuedToken policy assertion, and so we need to add support for the SamlToken assertion, so that for example we can define SAML Assertions as a SupportingToken.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
