                                            <td class="description">      When using JAXB bindings, specifically &quot;generateMixedExtensions&quot; I am unable to build a service from a class.  I get the following exception when I publish the endpoint. A stripped down test case is attached.  If I specify the wsdlLocation annotation, things work fine, so it is a difference between how ReflectionServiceFactoryBean.buildServiceFromClass and .buildServiceFromWSDL work.<br/>
<br/>
