                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">        Currently, one CXF Jaxws service can only return one Response message to each Request. However, there are some use case that we want one request have multiple response messages. E.g. my service gets a request, and then, it replies 3 response messages to a JMS queue. <br/>
<br/>
  Can CXF support multiple response message for this kind of use case?<br/>
<br/>
David
  </td>
