</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      AttachmentUtil creates silly content ID:<br/>
<br/>
Line 159 of Attachment Util:<br/>
id = &quot;Content-ID: &lt;root.message@cxf.apache.org&quot;;<br/>
<br/>
Likely something is  wrong around there.   The best option is probably to move<br/>
the &quot;decode&quot; into the above &quot;if&quot; and set the id to just<br/>
root.message@cxf.apache.org or something at that point.<br/>
<br/>
And &quot;Content-ID: &quot; definitely shouldn&#39;t be there.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
