</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The AbstractUsernameTokenAuthenticatingInterceptor does not handle digest passwords correctly.<br/>
<br/>
boolean isHashed = usernameToken.isDerivedKey();<br/>
<br/>
should be:<br/>
<br/>
boolean isHashed = usernameToken.isHashed();
