    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Eric Soucy
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/May/11 23:23 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Jun/14 11:53 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 06/May/11 09:06 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      windows xp, cxf 2.4, MS Dynamics 2011 crm organization Web service (claims based). jdk 1.6.23, ADFS 2.0 STS
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am tring to call the Organization web service of the MS Dynamics CRM in a claims based configuration.<br/>
The code can connect to ADFS 2.0 to obtain a token. the 2nd request tries to connect to the CRM. I get a soap fault : An error occurred when verifying security for the message.<br/>
In the logs of the server I see : Cannot resolve KeyInfo for verifying signature: KeyInfo &#39;SecurityKeyIdentifier<br/>
Here is the complete sequence:<br/>
<br/>
INFO: Outbound Message<br/>
---------------------------<br/>
ID: 1<br/>
Address: https://sts1/adfs/services/trust/13/usernamemixed<br/>
Encoding: UTF-8<br/>
Content-Type: application/soap+xml; action=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-sx/ws-trust/200512/RST/Issue&quot;<br/>
Headers: {Accept=[*/*]}<br/>
Payload: &lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2003/05/soap-envelope&quot;&gt;&lt;soap:Header&gt;&lt;Action xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;&gt;http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-sx/ws-trust/200512/RST/Issue&lt;/Action&gt;&lt;MessageID xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;&gt;urn:uuid:0b60f2c3-6469-46b3-9d65-ee4f5b1e6ad8&lt;/MessageID&gt;&lt;To xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;&gt;https://sts1/adfs/services/trust/13/usernamemixed&lt;/To&gt;&lt;ReplyTo xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;&gt;&lt;Address&gt;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing/anonymous&lt;/Address&gt;&lt;/ReplyTo&gt;&lt;wsse:Security xmlns:wsse=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/2004/01/oasis-200401-wss-wssecurity-secext-1.0.xsd&quot; xmlns:wsu=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/2004/01/oasis-200401-wss-wssecurity-utility-1.0.xsd&quot; soap:mustUnderstand=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;wsu:Timestamp wsu:Id=&quot;TS-1&quot;&gt;&lt;wsu:Created&gt;2011-05-01T23:17:28.421Z&lt;/wsu:Created&gt;&lt;wsu:Expires&gt;2011-05-01T23:22:28.421Z&lt;/wsu:Expires&gt;&lt;/wsu:Timestamp&gt;&lt;wsse:UsernameToken wsu:Id=&quot;UsernameToken-2&quot;&gt;&lt;wsse:Username&gt;username&lt;/wsse:Username&gt;&lt;wsse:Password Type=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/2004/01/oasis-200401-wss-username-token-profile-1.0#PasswordText&quot;&gt;password&lt;/wsse:Password&gt;&lt;/wsse:UsernameToken&gt;&lt;/wsse:Security&gt;&lt;/soap:Header&gt;&lt;soap:Body&gt;&lt;wst:RequestSecurityToken xmlns:wst=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-sx/ws-trust/200512&quot;&gt;&lt;wst:SecondaryParameters&gt;&lt;trust:KeyType xmlns:trust=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-sx/ws-trust/200512&quot;&gt;http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-sx/ws-trust/200512/SymmetricKey&lt;/trust:KeyType&gt;&lt;trust:KeySize xmlns:trust=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-sx/ws-trust/200512&quot;&gt;256&lt;/trust:KeySize&gt;&lt;trust:Claims xmlns:trust=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-sx/ws