                <tr id="issuerow12506338" rel="12506338" data-issuekey="CXF-3493" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3493" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3493">CXF-3493</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                StaxUtils.copy(XMLStreamReader,XMLStreamWriter) does not preserve empty namespace URIs
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            aaron pieper
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            aaron pieper
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/May/11 21:14 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/Aug/11 14:43 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 06/May/11 10:16 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      StaxUtils.copy(XMLStreamReader,XMLStreamWriter)  fails to copy documents correctly if they declare a namespace with a zero-length URI. In some cases, this URI is frivolous, but in other cases it is important, such as in the following document:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;foo xmlns=&quot;http://example.com&quot;&gt;&lt;bar xmlns=&quot;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/foo&gt;<br/>
<br/>
StaxUtils will remove this zero-length URI, resulting in the following XML document:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;foo xmlns=&quot;http://example.com&quot;&gt;&lt;bar/&gt;&lt;/foo&gt;<br/>
<br/>
These two documents are not equivalent. In the first document, bar assumes the &quot;empty namespace&quot;. In the second document, &quot;bar&quot; assumes the example.com namespace.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    commons, namespaces, xml</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310060">    Novice
</td>
