                <tr id="issuerow12506677" rel="12506677" data-issuekey="CXF-3504" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3504" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3504">CXF-3504</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                for big attachment, a temporary file is left on disk and keep opend, if the application just close the DataSource&#39;s inputStream and doesn&#39;t consume it; 
    </p>
