                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                [cxf-codegen-plugin][Generate WSDL-&gt;Java][illegal character]
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
