                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF defines the ASM bundle in the jetty feature.<br/>
<br/>
Installing the jetty feature, due to the ASM bundle refresh (used in the Karaf system bundles), could set Karaf is an unstable state.<br/>
<br/>
CXF jetty feature shouldn&#39;t define the ASM bundle and should use the one provided by Karaf.
