                <tr id="issuerow12507142" rel="12507142" data-issuekey="CXF-3517" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3517" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3517">CXF-3517</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Generated SoapService class doesn&#39;t accept classpath WSDL
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Igor Nikolaev
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Igor Nikolaev
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 13/May/11 15:16 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/Aug/11 14:43 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/May/11 20:36 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently {{ServiceGenerator}} generates SoapService classes using {{service.vm}} template that loads WSLD in static initializer block the following way:<br/>
{code}<br/>
static {<br/>
    URL url = null;<br/>
    try {<br/>
        url = new URL(&quot;$wsdlLocation&quot;);<br/>
    } catch (MalformedURLException e) {<br/>
        System.err.println(&quot;Can not initialize the default wsdl from $wsdlLocation&quot;);<br/>
        // e.printStackTrace();<br/>
    }<br/>
    WSDL_LOCATION = url;<br/>
}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
This doesn&#39;t allow to specify WSDL as classpath resource: classpath:path/to/wsdl/service.wsdl<br/>
At the same time, WSDLToJava accepts above mentioned notation.<br/>
<br/>
I propose using existing {{URIResolver}} if appropriate and allow classpath WSDL
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
