                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Use the Requested(Un)AttachedReference returned from an STS to refer to a SecurityToken for signature
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
