                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
This task is to use the Requested(Un)AttachedReference returned from an STS to refer to a SecurityToken for signature. At the moment we construct a SecurityTokenReference element and set the appropriate ValueType (etc.) attributes on it, whereas we should just use whatever the STS returns.
