                                            <td class="description">      The policy reference wrapped in a &lt;wsp:policy&gt; element can not be resolved:<br/>
&lt;wsdl:definitions&gt;<br/>
   ...<br/>
      &lt;wsdl:binding name=&quot;GreeterSOAPBinding&quot; type=&quot;tns:Greeter&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;soap:binding style=&quot;document&quot; transport=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/http&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        <br/>
        &lt;wsp:Policy&gt; <br/>
           &lt;wsp:PolicyReference URI=&quot;#WSAM_Addressing_Policy&quot;/&gt;          <br/>
        &lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
       ....<br/>
       &lt;/wsdl:binding&gt;<br/>
       &lt;wsp:Policy wsu:Id=&quot;WSAM_Addressing_Policy&quot;<br/>
		xmlns:wsu=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/2004/01/oasis-200401-wss-wssecurity-utility-1.0.xsd&quot;&gt;<br/>
		&lt;wsam:Addressing&gt;<br/>
			&lt;wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
				&lt;wsam:Addressing/&gt;<br/>
			&lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/wsam:Addressing&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
&lt;/wsdl:definitions&gt;<br/>
<br/>
