                <tr id="issuerow12508701" rel="12508701" data-issuekey="CXF-3557" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3557" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3557">CXF-3557</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Generated WebServiceClient code should not use System.err.println
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Laurent Perez
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Laurent Perez
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/May/11 10:37 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/Aug/11 14:43 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 31/May/11 17:59 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hello<br/>
<br/>
One of our clients PMD rules fails while validating a CXF generated class for a @WebServiceClient.<br/>
<br/>
The problem is that there is a raw System.err.println(&quot;Can not initialize the default wsdl from file:...&quot;) generated in the static{URL url} initializer.<br/>
<br/>
Would it be possible to use a Commons Logging delegate instead of a raw print statement ?<br/>
<br/>
Thanks<br/>

  </td>
