                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
This task is to add the ability to cache SAML tokens that are returned from an STS instance in the STSTokenValidator. An &quot;Associated Hash&quot; int is added to the CXF SecurityToken class. On receiving a UsernameToken which is to be dispatched to an STS for validation via WS-Trust, if it is transformed into a SAML Assertion a hash of the UsernameToken is associated with the returned Assertion, which is stored in the TokenStore. 
