                                            <td class="environment">      AIX, WebSphere7.0, spring 2.5
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi<br/>
I have generated service client using cxf tools from wsdl file which contains three soapActions. While i create one instance of service and use it for invoking three different methods cxf always sends in header soapAction from method that was invoked first time. For example:<br/>
<br/>
Methods:<br/>
1. invokeA - soapAction = invokeA<br/>
2. invokeB - soapAction = invokeB<br/>
3. invokeC - soapAction = invokeC<br/>
<br/>
first action is invokeB, valid request with soapAction=invokeB, second action is invokeC, invalid request with soapAction=invokeB<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
