                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The coloc feature currently limits its use only for the POJO based services (at the cosumer and the provider). In other word, one cannot use a generic Dispatch client to post a Source xml to a POJO or a generic Source based provider service over the coloc shortcut.<br/>
<br/>
This patch removes this limitation.<br/>

