                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
When reading the attachment streams using ins.read(buf, 300, 500) or similar (using the middle of a  byte buffer), when a boundary is reached, not all the data is pushed back.   The result is that attachment headers get lost and thus attachments are not found.<br/>

