</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Regression from 2.3.5 : An invalid security token was provided (Bad TokenType &quot;&quot;)
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
