                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Mac os X
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The server with metro and glassfish.<br/>
The client is running with cxf.<br/>
The client running with a wsdl and interpret the security policy. It runs fine with cxf 2.3.5<br/>
but it cannot read the response with cxf 2.4.1. It throws org.apache.ws.security.WSSecurityException: An invalid security token was provided (Bad TokenType &quot;&quot;).<br/>
<br/>
