                <tr id="issuerow12511081" rel="12511081" data-issuekey="CXF-3608" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3608" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3608">CXF-3608</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CXF JAX-RS selection algorithm always prefers resource methods to subresource locators
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Jun/11 11:09 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Aug/11 03:30 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Jun/11 11:37 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.6,                     2.4.2,                     2.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      JAX-RS 1.1 spec says:<br/>
<br/>
Sort E using the number of literal characters in each member as the primary key (descending order), the number of capturing groups as a secondary key (descending order), the number of capturing groups with non-default regular expressions (i.e. not &#39;([^ /]+?)&#39;) as the tertiary key (descending order), and the source of each member as quaternary key sorting those derived from Tmethod ahead of those derived from Tlocator. <br/>
<br/>
At the moment CXF JAX-RS using the &quot;the source of each member&quot; criteria as the primary key, thus<br/>
<br/>
given<br/>
<br/>
@Path(&quot;/&quot;)<br/>
public Resource {<br/>
    @Path(&quot;somepath&quot;) <br/>
    Subresource getSub() {}<br/>
<br/>
    @GET @Path(&quot;{id}&quot;)<br/>
    Book get(@PathParam(&quot;id&quot;) String id) {} <br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
get() method will always be preferred even though a subresource locator has a more specific path expression
  </td>
