<br/>
\\<br/>
This one is for the property &quot;{{java.lang.Class#enumConstants}}&quot; and I guess there are even more errors coming.<br/>
<br/>
What I had in ming was to substitute &quot;java.lang.Class&quot; with &quot;java.lang.String&quot; on-the-fly, so that there is an automatic default handling, e.g.:<br/>
* {{public &lt;T extends Serializable&gt; T createInstance(Class&lt;T&gt; type)}} will become something like {{public Serializable createInstance(String type)}}<br/>
* {{public Class getType(Serializable obj)}} will become something like {{public String getType(Serializable obj)}}<br/>
<br/>
...so that CXF internally does something like &quot;{{ClassLoaderUtils.loadClass(type, refClass);}}&quot; and &quot;{{type.getName()}}&quot; for the other way around.<br/>
<br/>
What do you think?
