                                            <td class="description">      Running the samples/js_browser_client_simple demo client, it raises an exception with full stack trace. This exception is expected and caught correctly by the client but any new user will probably initially believe the demo had failed. The README.txt does not mention that the client will also test for an exception. <br/>
