                <tr id="issuerow12513212" rel="12513212" data-issuekey="CXF-3646" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3646" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3646">CXF-3646</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Use of asymmetric key is implicit and defaults to RSA_SHA1 in the security policy implementation
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            vaidya.krishnamurthy
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            vaidya.krishnamurthy
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 08/Jul/11 03:14 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/Aug/11 18:19 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 02/Aug/11 19:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.2,                     2.5            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core,                     WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Linux
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">        Since the use of SHA1 has been recently discouraged I tried to switch to using atleast SHA256 ( http://www.w3.org/TR/xmldsig-core1/#sec-MessageDigests )<br/>
<br/>
        Currently the policy is set like this in the wsdl file :<br/>
<br/>
           &lt;sp:AlgorithmSuite&gt;<br/>
              &lt;wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
                &lt;sp:Basic256Sha256Rsa15/&gt;<br/>
              &lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/sp:AlgorithmSuite&gt;<br/>
<br/>
        From the log   I can see that a part of the message is signed with rsa-sha1<br/>
<br/>
&lt;ds:Signature xmlns:ds=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#&quot; Id=&quot;Signature-2&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;ds:SignedInfo&gt;<br/>
&lt;ds:CanonicalizationMethod Algorithm=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/10/xml-exc-c14n#&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;ds:SignatureMethod Algorithm=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#rsa-sha1&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;ds:Reference URI=&quot;#Timestamp-1&quot;&gt;<br/>
<br/>
         <br/>

  </td>
