</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">       <br/>
The jms transport has commons-pool as a runtime scope.  However, it&#39;s not needed for compile and it&#39;s only needed at runtime if using ActiveMQ.   The ActiveMQ poms would pull that in anyway.   Thus, it should be either removed or moved to test scope.
