  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      If the path url has space like<br/>
/Users/ffang/apache-cxf-2.4.1/samples/jax_rs/my basic/<br/>
then the resolved file url is <br/>
/Users/ffang/apache-cxf-2.4.1/samples/jax_rs/my%20basic/target/classes/demo/jaxrs/client/update_customer.xml<br/>
here %20 represent space, it&#39;s ok on windows platform but not ok on mac, on mac we need replaceAll(&quot;%20&quot;, &quot; &quot;);<br/>
we should use org.apache.cxf.resource.URIResolver to resolve the file url here which both works on windows and *nix.<br/>

