                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The example for MessageBodyWriter on http://cxf.apache.org/docs/jax-rs-basics.html#JAX-RSBasics-CustomMessageBodyProviders contains:<br/>
<br/>
@ProduceMime(&quot;text/plain&quot;)<br/>
<br/>
Which I believe should be:<br/>
<br/>
@Produces(&quot;text/plain&quot;)
