                <tr id="issuerow12514915" rel="12514915" data-issuekey="CXF-3676" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3676" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3676">CXF-3676</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add @threadSafe to all maven-plugins for parallel build feature of Maven3
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Falko Modler
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Falko Modler
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Jul/11 14:37 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Aug/11 03:30 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Jul/11 19:18 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.12,                     2.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Maven 3.0.3
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Please add @threadSafe to the Mojos to get rid of the warning that Maven 3 issues when one of them is involved in a multi module parallel build.<br/>
<br/>
See:<br/>
https://cwiki.apache.org/MAVEN/parallel-builds-in-maven-3.html<br/>
<br/>
Warning example:<br/>
<br/>
[WARNING] *****************************************************************<br/>
[WARNING] * Your build is requesting parallel execution, but project *<br/>
[WARNING] * contains the following plugin(s) that are not marked as *<br/>
[WARNING] * @threadSafe to support parallel building. *<br/>
[WARNING] * While this /may/ work fine, please look for plugin updates *<br/>
[WARNING] * and/or request plugins be made thread-safe. *<br/>
