</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CXF Examples (multiple), Warnings: The method toURL() from the type File is deprecated
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Trivial
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
