                                            <td class="description">      Sometimes it is necessary to customize a behavior of wss4j.<br/>
It&#39;s possible with org.apache.cxf.ws.security.wss4j.WSS4JInInterceptor and org.apache.cxf.ws.security.wss4j.WSS4JOutInterceptor by means of wss4j.action.map and wss4j.processor.map properties.<br/>
<br/>
However it&#39;s hardly possible to do with org.apache.cxf.ws.security.wss4j.PolicyBasedWSS4JInInterceptor and org.apache.cxf.ws.security.wss4j.PolicyBasedWSS4JOutInterceptor<br/>

