                <tr id="issuerow12517936" rel="12517936" data-issuekey="CXF-3710" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3710" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3710">CXF-3710</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Spring created clients should be destroyed when the context is closed
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Aug/11 16:58 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Aug/11 03:30 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 04/Aug/11 17:09 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
With the fix to CXF-3697, the clients will have their destroy method called eventually, but it could be long after the spring context is closed and the bus is shutdown (and thus the lifecycle listeners are gone).   It would be good if spring would close the clients at context close.
  </td>
