                <tr id="issuerow12517937" rel="12517937" data-issuekey="CXF-3711" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3711" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3711">CXF-3711</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Closing/destroying a client could initialize the conduits
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Aug/11 17:00 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Aug/11 03:30 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 04/Aug/11 17:09 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
When a client is closed/destroyed, it calls getConduitSelector().selectConduit(...) so that it can close the conduit.   If the client has never been used, that can cause a conduit to be created, the ConduitInitatorManager in the bus to be loaded, etc... which is wasteful and could cause issues if the bus has been shutdown, etc...    It would be good to avoid that if the conduit has never been used.
  </td>
