                <tr id="issuerow12518306" rel="12518306" data-issuekey="CXF-3724" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3724" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3724">CXF-3724</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Problem with CXF migration !!
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Incomplete
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Younes TERRIRESS
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Younes TERRIRESS
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 09/Aug/11 11:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Dec/11 16:15 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 29/Nov/11 18:57 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">259200</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">259200</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
 Currently working on a large project based on SOA architecture, hence the use of CXF framework.<br/>
 The team decided to migrate from  2.2.7 version of  CXF to 2.4.<br/>
 The problem occurs when starting tomcat server. You will find enclosed the server console.<br/>
<br/>
