</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have a vendor specific keystore type. As a rule such a keystore is located on an external device.<br/>
With current implementation of TLSParameterJaxBUtils only PKCS11 keystores do not expect file/url/resource to be specified.<br/>
So it&#39;s not possible to use keystores with empty file/url/resource.
