                <tr id="issuerow12518571" rel="12518571" data-issuekey="CXF-3732" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3732" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3732">CXF-3732</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                xjc generates no JAXBElement for nillable element with required attribute 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Dirk Lattermann
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Dirk Lattermann
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Aug/11 09:22 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Oct/11 17:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Aug/11 16:23 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAXB Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Please consider the following schema:<br/>
<br/>
{quote}<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot; ?&gt;<br/>
&lt;xsd:schema xmlns:xsd=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.example.org&quot; targetNamespace=&quot;http://www.example.org&quot; elementFormDefault=&quot;qualified&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;xsd:element name=&quot;root&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;xsd:complexType&gt;<br/>
      &lt;xsd:sequence&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xsd:element name=&quot;eal&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;<br/>
          &lt;xsd:complexType&gt;<br/>
            &lt;xsd:simpleContent&gt;<br/>
              &lt;xsd:extension base=&quot;xsd:string&quot;&gt;<br/>
                &lt;xsd:attribute name=&quot;att&quot; type=&quot;xsd:string&quot; use=&quot;required&quot;/&gt;<br/>
              &lt;/xsd:extension&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/xsd:simpleContent&gt;<br/>
          &lt;/xsd:complexType&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/xsd:element&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/xsd:sequence&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/xsd:complexType&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/xsd:element&gt;<br/>
{quote}<br/>
<br/>
Running this through xjc generates a member {{eal}} of type {{Root.Eal}} in {{Root}}, not of type {{JAXBElement&lt;Root.Eal&gt;}}.<br/>
This makes it impossible to unmarshal a document like<br/>
<br/>
{quote}<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot; standalone=&quot;yes&quot;?&gt;<br/>
&lt;root xmlns=&quot;http://www.example.org&quot; xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;eal att=&quot;j&quot; xsi:nil=&quot;true&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/root&gt;<br/>
{quote}<br/>
<br/>
and obtain the value for attribute {{att}} in {{eal}}, since {{eal}} is null. The above XML document cannot be represented in the classes generated by xjc.<br/>

  </td>
