                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The comments in the following files reference incorrect names.<br/>
<br/>
For example, in wsdl2corba.bat, a comment read:<br/>
<br/>
--&gt; rem  invoke the Apache CXF wsdl2java tool<br/>
<br/>
However, it should read:<br/>
<br/>
--&gt; rem  invoke the Apache CXF wsdl2corba tool<br/>
<br/>
This is a trivial issue, but I&#39;m supplying a diff for it nonetheless.
  </td>
