                                            <td class="description">      Since bouncy castle has been removed from the distribution, the license file should be removed as well; \apache-cxf-2.4.1\licenses\bouncy-castle.txt.<br/>
<br/>
Also, in the DEPENDENCIES file of the cxf-manifest.jar, there is reference to the Eclipse license.  Therefore shouldn&#39;t this license (file) be added to the licenses folder (i.e., \apache-cxf-2.4.1\licenses\).  I don&#39;t understand though why this is here... where is it included in the distro?<br/>
<br/>
