</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3757" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3757">CXF-3757</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JMX instrumentation for WS-RM component
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/Aug/11 13:59 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Nov/11 02:11 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/Sep/11 09:09 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      WS-RM provides asynchronous delivery of messages by using its own specific objects such as sequences and queues. As its processing is asynchronous, there is a need for monitoring those components that are otherwise hidden.<br/>
<br/>
A JMX based instrumentation for those WS-RM components will be provided to fulfill this need.<br/>
<br/>
Among others, the information on the source and destination sequences, their acknowledgement ranges, as well as the retransmission queue&#39;s status will be made accessible.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
