                <tr id="issuerow12519830" rel="12519830" data-issuekey="CXF-3759" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3759" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3759">CXF-3759</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                wadl2java fails with NullPointerException if status codes of multiple response elements are not in ascending numerical order
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Oliver Jelinski
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Oliver Jelinski
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/Aug/11 14:30 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Oct/11 17:30 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Aug/11 12:26 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.3,                     2.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Strangely, if I have the status codes in the response not in ascending order in the wadl-document, wadl2java fails with NPE.<br/>
<br/>
For example the following works correctly:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;<br/>
&lt;application <br/>
  xmlns=&quot;http://wadl.dev.java.net/2009/02&quot;<br/>
