                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using CXF&#39;s wsdl2java tool, generated exceptions always extend java.lang.Exception. It would be nice if exceptions could optionally extend java.lang.RuntimeException instead. This could be accomplished by adding a flag like -exceptionSuper=.... on the wsdl2java tool, which would allow us to  specify our own superclass.
  </td>
