                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-3766                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently, CXF features use specific version for spring and spring-dm features.<br/>
<br/>
It means that if CXF upgrade to a new Spring version, if Karaf doesn&#39;t update to the same version, CXF won&#39;t be installable in Karaf.<br/>
<br/>
To avoid this situation, CXF should use version range for features provided by Karaf.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m gonna provide a patch for that.
  </td>
