<br/>
I edited the file common-build.xml. I replaced the section:<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;condition property=&quot;is.java.version.15&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;or&gt;<br/>
            &lt;equals arg1=&quot;${ant.java.version}&quot; arg2=&quot;1.5&quot;/&gt;<br/>
