                <tr id="issuerow12520707" rel="12520707" data-issuekey="CXF-3777" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3777" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3777">CXF-3777</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                WS-RM provider may try to send a CreateSequence message to the anonymous endpoint in some cases
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Aug/11 08:26 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Oct/11 17:30 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Aug/11 16:04 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.3,                     2.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">7200</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">7200</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When a WS-RM client wrongly sends out a CreateSeqeunce message for twoway calls without a create sequence offer and without a decoupled replyTo endpoint, the WS-RM server/provider tries to send a CreateSequence message to the anonymous endpoint (http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing/anonymous) and results in an exception such as:<br/>
<br/>
Caused by: org.apache.cxf.transport.http.HTTPException: HTTP response &#39;401: Authorization Required&#39; when communicating with http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing/anonymous<br/>
<br/>
The server should not try to send a CreateSequence message to the anonymous endpoint and instead should handle this situation by throwing a more descriptive exception.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m fixing it to throw an RMException with the following more descriptive text (which I add to the props file).<br/>
<br/>
CREATE_SEQ_ANON_TARGET = It is not possible to send a create sequence request to the anonymous address {0}<br/>

  </td>
