                                            <td class="description">      I moved several of the sample project WSDL&#39;s to a temporary location and performed WSDL validation with CXF&#39;s wsdlvalidator tool.  Below are some results that may flag the need for the associated WSDL&#39;s to be refined:<br/>
<br/>
===========================================================<br/>
c:\apache-cxf-2.4.2\bin\wsdlvalidator bank.wsdl<br/>
WSDLValidator Error : Mixed style, invalid WSDL<br/>
===========================================================<br/>
