WSDLValidator Error : <br/>
line 127 column 57 of file:/C:/WSDLS/jms_greeter.wsdl: cvc-complex-type.3.2.2: Attribute &#39;soapaction&#39; is not allowed to appear in element &#39;soap:operation&#39;.<br/>
===========================================================<br/>
