WSDLValidator Error : WSI-BP-1.0 R2718 violation: A wsdl:binding in a DESCRIPTION MUST have the same set of wsdl:operations as the wsdl:portType to which it refers. greetMe not found in wsdl:binding.<br/>
===========================================================<br/>
c:\apache-cxf-2.4.2\bin\wsdlvalidator BankWS.wsdl<br/>
Aug 30, 2011 11:26:32 AM org.apache.cxf.tools.validator.internal.WSDLRefValidator collectValidationPoints<br/>
