                <tr id="issuerow12521191" rel="12521191" data-issuekey="CXF-3789" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3789" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3789">CXF-3789</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                org.apache.cxf.endpoint.ClientImpl.invoke(BindingOperationInfo, Object[], Exchange) wastes cycles
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Gary Gregory
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Gary Gregory
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Sep/11 14:36 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Oct/11 17:30 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 02/Sep/11 16:06 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.7,                     2.4.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Apache Maven 3.0.3 (r1075438; 2011-02-28 12:31:09-0500)<br/>
Maven home: C:\Java\apache-maven-3.0.3\bin\..<br/>
Java version: 1.6.0_24, vendor: Sun Microsystems Inc.<br/>
Java home: C:\Program Files\Java\jdk1.6.0_24\jre<br/>
Default locale: en_US, platform encoding: Cp1252<br/>
OS name: &quot;windows 7&quot;, version: &quot;6.1&quot;, arch: &quot;amd64&quot;, family: &quot;windows&quot;
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      While debugging our server, I saw in {{org.apache.cxf.endpoint.ClientImpl.invoke(BindingOperationInfo, Object[], Exchange)}}:<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
Map&lt;String, Object&gt; resp = new HashMap&lt;String, Object&gt;();<br/>
resp.clear();<br/>
{code}<br/>
That&#39;s silly and a noop. Attaching patch to remove and do:<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
Map&lt;String, Object&gt; resp = new HashMap&lt;String, Object&gt;();<br/>
{code}<br/>
If you want an empty map to avoid wasting space for a rarely used feature, perhaps use:<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
Map&lt;String, Object&gt; resp = new HashMap&lt;String, Object&gt;(0);<br/>
{code}<br/>
or:<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
Map&lt;String, Object&gt; resp = new HashMap&lt;String, Object&gt;(1);<br/>
{code}<br/>

  </td>
