                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
in org/apache/cxf/karaf/apache-cxf/2.4.2/apache-cxf-2.4.2-features.xml is an error:<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;feature name=&quot;saaj-impl&quot; version=&quot;1.3.2&quot;  resolver=&#39;(obr)&#39;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;bundle start-level=&#39;25&#39;&gt;mvn:org.apache.servicemix.bundles/org.apache.servicemix.bundles.saaj-impl/1.3.2_2&lt;/bundle&gt;<br/>
        &lt;bundle start-level=&#39;25&#39;&gt;mvn:org.apache.servicemix.bundles/org.apache.servicemix.bundles.jaxpri/1.4.4_2&lt;/bundle&gt;   <br/>
    &lt;/feature&gt;<br/>
<br/>
jaxpri should be jaxp-ri!!!<br/>
<br/>
Can somepne confirm this?<br/>
<br/>
Thx
  </td>
