                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      latest stable Ubuntu, amd64, java version &quot;1.6.0_22&quot;<br/>
OpenJDK Runtime Environment (IcedTea6 1.10.2) (6b22-1.10.2-0ubuntu1~11.04.1)<br/>
OpenJDK 64-Bit Server VM (build 20.0-b11, mixed mode) 
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      running &quot;mvn&quot; to build latest stable CXF or latest trunk CXF yields the following build error:<br/>
<br/>
Results :<br/>
<br/>
Failed tests: testDigestPasswordUnauthorized(org.apache.cxf.ws.security.wss4j.UserNameTokenAuthorizationTest): expected:&lt;[Unauthorize]d&gt; but was:&lt;[The signature or decryption was invali]d&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Tests in error:<br/>
  testSignedEncryptedPartsWithIncompleteCoverage(org.apache.cxf.ws.security.wss4j.PolicyBasedWss4JInOutTest): The signature or decryption was invalid<br/>
  testSignedEncryptedPartsWithCompleteCoverage(org.apache.cxf.ws.security.wss4j.PolicyBasedWss4JInOutTest): The signature or decryption was invalid<br/>
