                                            <td class="description">      Using CXF dynamic client with CXF service model fails to invoke the ServiceNow public demo web service. It throws a ClassCastException. Attaching a sample project that has test case that shows this problem. Appreciate if you could advice on this behavior. I tried debugging, but it looks like the wrapper helpers (com.service_now.incident.GetRecords_WrapperTypeHelper1) are created on the fly and could not step through.<br/>
