                                            <td class="description">      Some examples of CXF doesn&#39;t have the maven pom.xml, we need to add the support of it.<br/>
(1) Hello World sample using JavaScript and E4X Implementations - (js_provider)<br/>
(2) Groovy with Spring Support - (groovy_spring_support)<br/>
(3) Ruby Script - (ruby_spring_support)<br/>
(4) CORBA Bank - (corba\bank)<br/>
(5) CORBA Bank with WS-Addressing - (corba\bank_ws_addressing)<br/>
(6) CORBA Hello World - (corba\hello_world)<br/>
(7) MTOSI Alarm Retrieval (SOAP OVER HTTP) - (e.g., mtosi_1.1\alarm_retrieval)<br/>
(8) JCA/JBI integration samples - (integration[jca\jbi]*
  </td>
