                <tr id="issuerow12524594" rel="12524594" data-issuekey="CXF-3823" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3823" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3823">CXF-3823</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                cxf-rt-transport-http-jetty should have the dependency of servlet API 2.5 instead of 3.0
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/Sep/11 02:23 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Oct/11 17:30 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Sep/11 03:34 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4,                     2.4.1,                     2.4.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      From CXF 2.4.x, we introduced the servlet API 3.0 dependency on the cxf-rt-transport-http-jetty.<br/>
As you know Jetty7 is targeting Servlet API 2.5 and JVM 1.5, if you are try some Servlet3 new feature like continuation, you will get some complain from jetty. Although it could be peaceful if use doesn&#39;t touch the Request or Response object in CXF application when CXF use the Servlet API 3.0 with cxf-rt-transport-http-jetty, but there are still some user need to touch the Serlvet API themselves.<br/>
<br/>
So I want to change the servlet API dependency of cxf-rt-transport-http-jetty to 2.5 to avoid this situation.  
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
