                <tr id="issuerow12524596" rel="12524596" data-issuekey="CXF-3824" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3824" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3824">CXF-3824</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CLI tool -help should be able to list all switch in toolspec
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/Sep/11 04:19 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Oct/11 17:30 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Sep/11 05:45 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.7,                     2.4.3,                     2.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      currently -help flag can only list the first switch in option, for example if we have<br/>
&lt;switch&gt;a&lt;/switch&gt;<br/>
&lt;switch&gt;address&lt;/switch&gt;<br/>
&lt;associatedArgument placement=&quot;afterSpace&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;annotation&gt;address&lt;/annotation&gt;<br/>
&lt;/associatedArgument&gt;<br/>
then only the first one get listed like<br/>
-a &lt;address&gt;<br/>
though the -address can also be accepted but it&#39;s not easy for end user to get all acceptable options<br/>
it should be<br/>
-a|-address &lt;address&gt;
  </td>
