                <tr id="issuerow12526632" rel="12526632" data-issuekey="CXF-3854" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3854" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3854">CXF-3854</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                java.lang.StringIndexOutOfBoundsException is thrown when generating sources for a WADL with WADL2Java Maven plugin
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Lars Weber
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Lars Weber
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Oct/11 09:57 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Nov/11 02:11 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Oct/11 16:41 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.5            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.5,                     2.4.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Build system,                     JAX-RS,                     JAXB Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Apache Maven 2.2.1 (rdebian-4)<br/>
Java version: 1.6.0_26<br/>
Java home: /usr/lib/jvm/java-6-sun-1.6.0.26/jre<br/>
Default locale: en_US, platform encoding: UTF-8<br/>
OS name: &quot;linux&quot; version: &quot;2.6.38-11-generic&quot; arch: &quot;amd64&quot; Family: &quot;unix&quot;
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I want to create the client stubs with a .wadl file.<br/>
*Before you ask, it&#39;s not possible for me to attach the file due to an NDA.*<br/>
<br/>
(on) *Important:*<br/>
It works fine, if I don&#39;t use the {{&lt;extraarg&gt;-impl&lt;/extraarg&gt;}} extraarg.<br/>
<br/>
This is the maven plugin definition in the {{pom.xml}} file:<br/>
<br/>
{code:xml} <br/>
&lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
    &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.cxf&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
    &lt;artifactId&gt;cxf-wadl2java-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
    &lt;!-- version&gt;2.4.1&lt;/version --&gt;<br/>
    &lt;version&gt;2.5.0-SNAPSHOT&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
    &lt;executions&gt;<br/>
            &lt;execution&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;id&gt;generate-sources&lt;/id&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;phase&gt;generate-sources&lt;/phase&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;configuration&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;sourceRoot&gt;${basedir}/target/generated/src/main/java&lt;/sourceRoot&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;wadlOptions&gt;<br/>
                                    &lt;wadlOption&gt;<br/>
                                            &lt;wadl&gt;${basedir}/src/main/resources/wadl/myWadlFile.wadl&lt;/wadl&gt;<br/>
                                            &lt;!-- impl&gt;true&lt;/impl --&gt;<br/>
                                            &lt;packagename&gt;org.apache.cxf.systest.jaxrs.codegen.service&lt;/packagename&gt;<br/>
                                            &lt;schemaPackagenames&gt;<br/>
                                                    &lt;schemaPackagename&gt;http://MYPACKNAME=org.apache.cxf.systest.jaxrs.codegen.schema&lt;/schemaPackagename&gt;<br/>
                                            &lt;/schemaPackagenames&gt;<br/>
                                            &lt;extraargs&gt;<br/>
                                                    &lt;extraarg&gt;-impl&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
                                                    &lt;extraarg&gt;-interface&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
                                                    &lt;extraarg&gt;-verbose&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
                                            &lt;/extraargs&gt;<br/>
                                    &lt;/wadlOption&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;/wadlOptions&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;/configuration&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;goals&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;goal&gt;wadl2java&lt;/goal&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;/goals&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/execution&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/executions&gt;<br/>
&lt;/plugin&gt;<br/>
{code} <br/>
<br/>
Then, after calling {{mvn clean generate-sources}}, I get this exception:<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
[INFO] ------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>
