                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When the the binding file like the below is gave to customize the package name and there is some &quot;..&quot; or &quot;.&quot; in the given wsdl url, wsdl2java fails to generate the class in the expected package :<br/>
<br/>
----binding file ----------<br/>
<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot; standalone=&quot;yes&quot;?&gt;<br/>
&lt;bindings wsdlLocation=&quot;hello-world.wsdl&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://java.sun.com/xml/ns/jaxws&quot;&gt;    <br/>
    &lt;bindings node=&quot;ns1:definitions&quot; xmlns:ns1=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/wsdl/&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;package name=&quot;org.apache.cxf&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/bindings&gt;<br/>
&lt;/bindings&gt;<br/>
<br/>
----command to generate code ---<br/>
wsdl2java -b bindingfile.xml file://home/usr/hello/world/../../hello-world.wsdl 
