    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3863" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3863">CXF-3863</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Warning info since build service from wsdl of JaxWsServiceFactoryBean once I located the wsdl location
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
