                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The provider is missing a setter for classResources property. <br/>
Having to specify a beanNames map in case of the provider serving different beans is useful but a simpler bean name property is needed. <br/>
Sometimes it handy to choose the dispatchers based on the actual request URI (relative part).<br/>
At the moment all the additional params are saved as servler parameters - an option to save them as attributes is needed. 
