                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
Attached file should replace the META-INF/spring/osgiservlet.xml file to setup and register the CXF Servlet/PAX-WEB based http transport.   The new version uses blueprint to setup and register the service instead of Spring-DM.  The result is more reliable startup (no &quot;cannot find namespace handler...&quot; issues) and less dependencies on spring.<br/>
<br/>

