                <tr id="issuerow12531605" rel="12531605" data-issuekey="CXF-3917" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3917" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3917">CXF-3917</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Schema validation does not resolve relative schema locations
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Pablo Kraan
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Pablo Kraan
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 16/Nov/11 12:32 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Nov/11 14:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/Nov/11 14:04 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Relative schema location works OK when schema validation is not enabled, but when is enabled the validator is not able to properly resolve the relative schema locations.<br/>
<br/>
The problem is simple: the ResolvingGrammarReaderController does not try to resolve the relative schema files, it just returns null every time is invoked, so the relative schema files are not resolved using the WSDL base path, they are attempted to be resolved using the base path of the running application. The fix is just to pass the base URI and use a URIResolver to resolve the entities.<br/>
<br/>
We are using CXF inside Mule and I have no experience working with CXF alone, so I don&#39;t have a way to reproduce this and the wstx-msv-validation module does not have any test that I can use as an example... but the fix was tested from our side and works :)<br/>
<br/>
NOTE: the problem was detected using CXF 2.3.1 but the relevant code in trunk is still the same.<br/>

  </td>
