                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If you define a soap/jms service using the JmsConfigFeature then the transportUri in the SoapBindingInfo is still &quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/http/&quot; but it should be &quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/jms/&quot; <br/>
<br/>
According to Dan the uri should be correct when the SOAP/JMS spec is used to configure the transport.<br/>

