                                            <td class="description">      &lt;xsd:schema<br/>
	targetNamespace=&quot;http://TestResponse/Response&quot;<br/>
	xmlns:bons0=&quot;http://TestResponse/Response&quot;<br/>
	xmlns:xsd=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema&quot;&gt;<br/>
	&lt;xsd:include schemaLocation=&quot;../A_Acknowledgement/A_Acknowledgements.xsd&quot; /&gt;<br/>
	&lt;xsd:complexType name=&quot;MessageDeliveryResponse&quot; abstract=&quot;false&quot;&gt;<br/>
		&lt;xsd:sequence&gt;<br/>
			&lt;xsd:element maxOccurs=&quot;unbounded&quot; minOccurs=&quot;0&quot;<br/>
				name=&quot;A_Acknowledgements&quot;<br/>
				type=&quot;bons:A_Acknowledgements&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/xsd:sequence&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/xsd:complexType&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xsd:schema&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
When generating the code using WSDL2Java, it returns an &quot;&#39;A_Acknowledgements&#39; is already defined&quot; error.<br/>
<br/>
However, it works if A_Acknowledgements.xsd file is moved to the same directory as the referencing schema (above) and modified to: &lt;xsd:include schemaLocation=&quot;A_Acknowledgements.xsd&quot; /&gt;<br/>

