                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We want to provide support for cross-origin resource sharing.<br/>
<br/>
A pair of JAX-RS filters can handle the relatively simple case: the same CORS policy for all resources, and uniform allowed method, headers, etc.<br/>
<br/>
A more complex scheme with per-resource control would be much harder.<br/>

