                <tr id="issuerow12535617" rel="12535617" data-issuekey="CXF-3978" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3978" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3978">CXF-3978</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Multiple BusApplicationContext Objects created by CXF
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Blocker
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Cannot Reproduce
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Dhawalpatel
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Dhawalpatel
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 18/Dec/11 11:10 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Aug/12 17:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/May/12 16:53 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Production
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi all, <br/>
Can anyone tell me if there was a known bug or issue wherein CXF creates a new BusApplicationCOntext object for each outgoing Web Service call? I see that while using JCA Connector architecture, SpringBusFactory object creates a new BusApplicationContext object. Is it a bug? I am running CXF in WebContainer thread pool of WAS and as the threads never gets killed due to pool, the BusApplicationContext objects accumulates and results in high GC memory. <br/>
Please help if this is a known bug in this version of CXF? We are in a production down situation due to memory overhead created by BusApplicationContext object size and number of these objects. there is one-one correspondence between BusApplicatioContext to Thread in thread pool which is causing memory to increase.<br/>
The version of cxf-bundle-fuse is 2-1-3-18 <br/>
THanks
  </td>
