                <tr id="issuerow12535864" rel="12535864" data-issuekey="CXF-3988" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3988" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3988">CXF-3988</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.ext.multipart.Attachment object should be mutable
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Dec/11 16:20 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 07/Feb/12 21:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Dec/11 23:15 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.5.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.6,                     2.5.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As currently coded, the headers in an Attachment are immutable after construction. This prevents a construction like:<br/>
<br/>
    - call a convenient constructor<br/>
    - add one more header<br/>
<br/>
Rather than change the contract of getHeaders, I propose to add put/putSingle to the contract of Attachment.<br/>

  </td>
