                <tr id="issuerow12536002" rel="12536002" data-issuekey="CXF-3990" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3990" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3990">CXF-3990</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Change scope for EffectivePolicyImpl.initilise() and EndpointPolicyImpl.initilise() to more permissive
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andrei Shakirin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andrei Shakirin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Dec/11 12:40 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 07/Feb/12 21:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Dec/11 22:26 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.6,                     2.5.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
All initilize() methods in EffectivePolicyImpl and EndpointPolicyImpl are package private.<br/>
Unfortunatelly it prevents reusing of these classes in custom use cases.<br/>
<br/>
Proposal: change method&#39;s scope to protected or public.<br/>
<br/>
Patch with public alternative is attached.<br/>
<br/>
Regards,<br/>
Andrei.
  </td>
