                <tr id="issuerow12536033" rel="12536033" data-issuekey="CXF-3991" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3991" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3991">CXF-3991</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Address information should be added to error message if conduit is not found
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andrei Shakirin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andrei Shakirin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Dec/11 15:43 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 07/Feb/12 21:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Dec/11 22:26 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.6,                     2.5.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
Error message if conduit is not found in SoapTransportFactory is not enough detailed, because transport id is the same for all SOAP based protocols (http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/http). It makes understaning of error difficult if conduit is assigned with custom protocol prefix (for example udp).<br/>
Physical address should be added to error message.<br/>
Patch is attached.<br/>
<br/>
TODO: check is this patch doesn&#39;t produce security hole.<br/>
<br/>
Regards,<br/>
Andrei.
  </td>
