    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4025" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4025">CXF-4025</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Please make it easier to make small changes to JMS configuration
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Jan/12 16:24 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 10/Apr/17 19:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Apr/17 18:46 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.5.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Configuration            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If I create a JMS endpoint, the destination name and all of that can be set up simply via the URL:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
svrFactory.setAddress(JmsUtils.cxfJmsUrl(taskId, jmsBrokerUrl));<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
However, as soon as I want to set *any* of the options in the JMSConfiguration object, I have to now come up with these facts for myself. I wish that there was a factory for JMSConfiguration objects that set up from a URL so that I could just set the parameters I care about (such as the concurrency params).<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

