                <tr id="issuerow12538174" rel="12538174" data-issuekey="CXF-4026" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4026" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4026">CXF-4026</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                SOAP re-declaring qname inside body 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Cannot Reproduce
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            David Portabella
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            David Portabella
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 12/Jan/12 10:32 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Dec/12 14:40 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Dec/12 16:45 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This request fails on CXF:<br/>
&lt;soapenv:Envelope <br/>
xmlns:soapenv=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot; <br/>
xmlns:myqname=&quot;http://example.com/hello&quot; <br/>
xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;soapenv:Header/&gt;<br/>
&lt;soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;myqname:MyRequest&gt;<br/>
...<br/>
&lt;/myqname:MyRequest&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soapenv:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
with the error:<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;soap:Fault&gt;<br/>
&lt;faultcode&gt;soap:Client&lt;/faultcode&gt;<br/>
&lt;faultstring&gt;Unmarshalling Error: UndeclaredPrefix: Cannot resolve &#39;myqname:MyRequest&#39; as a QName: the prefix &#39;myqname&#39; is not declared.&lt;/faultstring&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Fault&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
However, if I re-define the myqname inside the body node, then it works.<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soapenv:Envelope <br/>
xmlns:soapenv=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot; <br/>
xmlns:myqname=&quot;http://example.com/hello&quot; <br/>
xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;soapenv:Header/&gt;<br/>
&lt;soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;myqname:MyRequest xmlns:myqname=&quot;http://example.com/hello&quot;&gt;<br/>
...<br/>
&lt;/myqname:MyRequest&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soapenv:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Is this a bug from CXF?<br/>

  </td>
