                <tr id="issuerow12539097" rel="12539097" data-issuekey="CXF-4048" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4048" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4048">CXF-4048</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Make cxf-rt-indings-soap independent of cxf-tools-common
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Jan/12 07:45 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Apr/12 16:45 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Jan/12 15:44 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.5.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Soap Binding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      bindings soap depends on the tools common project. This introduces some unwanted dependencies like velocity and couples the runtime and tools unnecessarily. It seems there are three things needed from tools common:<br/>
- wrapper interfaces for soap wsdl extensions <br/>
- SOAPBindingUtil<br/>
- URIParserUtils<br/>
<br/>
I will move the wrapper interfaces and SOAPBindingUtil to bindings soap as they are very much related to soap. The URIParserUtils will be mioved to common utilities as it is needed in tools as well as in runtime.
  </td>
