    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4070" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4070">CXF-4070</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                cxf-codegen-plugin, wsdlto : troublesome exception during generate jax-ws binding when node is not exist
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Artur Wójcik
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Artur Wójcik
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Jan/12 11:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Apr/12 16:47 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 15/Feb/12 20:04 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Configuration:<br/>
<br/>
plugin :<br/>
			&lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
                &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.cxf&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
                &lt;artifactId&gt;cxf-codegen-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
                &lt;version&gt;2.4.2&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
                &lt;executions&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;execution&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;id&gt;generate-sources-default&lt;/id&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;phase&gt;generate-sources&lt;/phase&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;configuration&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;sourceRoot&gt;${project.build.directory}/generated-sources/cxf-default&lt;/sourceRoot&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;defaultOptions&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;bindingFiles&gt;<br/>
                                    &lt;bindingFile&gt;${project.basedir}/bindings/jaxws_binding.xml&lt;/bindingFile&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;/bindingFiles&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;/defaultOptions&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;wsdlRoot&gt;${basedir}&lt;/wsdlRoot&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;includes&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;include&gt;**/*.wsdl&lt;/include&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;/includes&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;/configuration&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;goals&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;goal&gt;wsdl2java&lt;/goal&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;/goals&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;/execution&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/executions&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/plugin&gt;<br/>
<br/>
jaxws_binding.xml :<br/>
<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;<br/>
&lt;jaxws:bindings xmlns:jaxws=&quot;http://java.sun.com/xml/ns/jaxws&quot;&gt;<br/>
	&lt;bindings xmlns=&quot;http://java.sun.com/xml/ns/jaxws&quot; node=&quot;wsdl:definitions/wsdl:portType/wsdl:operation/wsdl:fault&quot;&gt;<br/>
		&lt;package name=&quot;com.company.common.fault&quot; /&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/bindings&gt;<br/>
&lt;/jaxws:bindings&gt;<br/>
<br/>
So, I would like generate jax-ws binding for all wsdl&#39;s in project, <br/>
but not everyone has fault element. I want to have common things in one place.<br/>
Use wsdlOptions is not advisable.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m getting:<br/>
Could not find any node with the <br/>
XPath expression: //wsdl:definitions[wsdl:portType]/wsdl:portType/wsdl:operation/wsdl:fault<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

